WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.400
Cumming Connects: every local resource in one place.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.900
Tell the sign what you need and who it's for.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.900
Matching places appear right away.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.400
Open a place to see its address, phone, and hours.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.900
Call, get directions, or check the official source.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.900
Star a place to save it for later.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.400
Scroll through all 40 places.

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.300
Every card shows the address and phone number.

9
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.400
Tap Directions to get there.

10
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.600
The route opens in Google Maps.
